ation of embryo hatching and implantation by prostacyclin and peroxisome proliferator-activated receptor <italic>&#x003b4;</italic> activation: implication in IVF</article-title><source><italic>Human Reproduction</italic></source><year>2007</year><volume>22</volume><issue>3</issue><fpage>807</fpage><lpage>814</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17114194</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>